╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│                                                                                                  │
│  GETTING STARTED                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                  │
│    1. Create or restore a wallet with your password                                              │
│    2. Back up your seed phrase immediately - Settings (t) then (m)                               │
│    3. Generate a receive address (r) to accept bitcoin                                           │
│    4. Monitor balance, history, addresses, and UTXOs from the dashboard                          │
│                                                                                                  │
│  KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS                                                                              │
│                                                                                                  │
│    Navigation                                                                                    │
│      esc         Go back / Cancel                                                                │
│      q           Back on many screens; some dialogs use esc only; quit from dashboard            │
│      ?           Open help from dashboard / close help                                           │
│      ctrl+c      Quit application                                                                │
│                                                                                                  │
│    Dashboard                                                                                     │
│      ↑/↓         Navigate menu                                                                   │
│      enter       Open selected screen                                                            │
│      r           Receive bitcoin                                                                 │
│      s           Send bitcoin                                                                    │
│      h           Transaction history                                                             │
│      a           Addresses                                                                       │
│      u           UTXOs                                                                           │
│      F           Fee estimates from the current server                                           │
│      t           Settings                                                                        │
│      z           hide amounts (stealth mode)                                                     │
│      T           Re-trust a changed server key (when shown)                                      │
│                                                                                                  │
│    Receive                                                                                       │
│      esc/q       Back                                                                            │
│      c           Copy address to clipboard                                                       │
│      ←/→         Previous / next address                                                         │
│                                                                                                  │
